{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_47_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_47","textTraditional":"一、十有八年，春王三月，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_47_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_47","textTraditional":"二、夏，公追戎于濟西。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_47_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_47","textTraditional":"此未有言伐者，其言追何？大其為中國追也。此未有伐中國者，則其言為中國追何？大其未至而豫禦之也。其言于濟西何？大之也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_47_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_47","textTraditional":"三、秋有{或虫}。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_47_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_47","textTraditional":"何以書？記異也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_47_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_47","textTraditional":"四、冬十月。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}